{
 "_doc": "Tier-2 pool building (random towns, civic lots): a veterans' post - canteen bar, the hall (honor wall, bingo tables), the commander's office, a kitchen and, under it, the cellar with the quartermaster's cage where the fall raffle prize waits. Route: the front doors are chained from inside -> round the back: the kitchen door kicked in -> the kitchen -> the hall (the families who sheltered there) -> the bar: the cage key in the till (taking it wakes the hall: ambush) -> the back hall, down the cellar stair -> the cellar stores -> the cage: the quartermaster guards it -> back up and out through the vestibule, unchaining the front doors. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
